<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξότις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, ἡ, fem. of foreg., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>archeress,</i> of Atalanta, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				223
			</span></i>; of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				36.2
			</span></i>, etc.: as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. χείρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.188
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>):—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τοξότιδες,</span>
			name of a play by <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>loophole for shooting arrows,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.7.3
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a plant, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτεμισία</span>
			, Poet. <i>de herb.</i><i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apul.
				<u>Herb.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; also called <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξιτησία</span></b> , Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.113
			</span></i>.</div>
